      "text": "THE GREY ZONE \u2014 crypto \u00b7 AI \u00b7 early eBay \u00b7 gig work.\nNew businesses routinely operate where the law has not arrived yet.\nThat is not automatically wrong. It is the normal condition of innovation.",
